### ⑫ 学生复查详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609170001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ⑬ 学生身份受理（应 403）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609170001/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 0 }

### ⑭ 干事回复工单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609170001/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
