  "content": "好的，谢谢！如果 3 个工作日后还没录入，我需要再联系谁呢？",
  "requestId": "followup-001"
}

### ⑰ 干事查看详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609170001
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### ⑱ 干事手动完结
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609170001/close
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 3 }

### ⑲ 学生提交新工单
###     ⚠️ 这里以前**重复贴了两遍**（同一个 requestId `wo-002`、同一份内容），
###        第二遍那段还带着 `<新单号>` 占位符。⑧③ 接上幂等之后，
###        "同 requestId + 同参数"的第二次会变成**重放**、不会再新建一张单，
###        留着那段就成了一条"藏着的语义陷阱"（而且占位符本来就禁止用），所以删掉了。
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "规则疑问",
  "content": "请问第二课堂学时的年度上限是多少？跨学期可以累计吗？",
  "requestId": "wo-002"
}
### ⑳ 干事受理新单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609210001/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 0 }

### ㉑ 故意用过期版本关单 → 应 409 版本冲突
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609210001/close
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 0 }

### ㉒ 干事回复 → 变成 REPLIED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609210001/reply
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "同学你好，第二课堂每学年学时上限为 40 个，跨学期不可累计，请以当学年为准。", "requestId": "reply-002" }
### ㉓ 学生确认解决 → CONFIRM 关闭
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-orders/WO202609210001/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 2 }

